{"2544590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "리프 인 부트스트랩 - LEAP IN BOOTSTRAP", "steam_appid": 2544590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2967740, 2559040], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When is the moment you want to forget the most?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Soo-ah, a geek high school girl, and Shin Ha-yeon, a grumpy tsundere, and A, a high school student, are members of the science club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who gathered to prepare for the school summer festival lost their minds in the heat of summer vacation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Soo-ah, tired of the lame entry, declares the invention of the time machine...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the past, make the future! &quot;Leaf in Bootstrap&quot;, here we go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producer Information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by Eugene Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration: Halla Tangerine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shin Ha-yeon as Lee Eun-jo LEE EUN JO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Soo-ah as Herela HEOELLA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directing: Choi Jinwoo CHOI JIN WOO [PLUSDICTION DIRECTOR]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording: Olje Studio OLZE STUDIO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within 15 days of repetition, different routes will proceed according to the user's choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played sequentially from day 1 to day 15, and for some routes, the day of the week may be omitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of Day 15, the ending will be printed and will return to Day 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some routes affect the cancellation of other routes. Even if you exit the game, the cancellation will be maintained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select: Left-click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line progression: left click, scroll down mouse, enter key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip image: Keyboard ESC key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fixed at a resolution of 16:9 for optimal play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to this when adjusting the resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※The game contains some sensational elements. (There is CG wearing a bikini on the beach) ※</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※The game contains some violent elements. (There is a bloody expression of death.) ※</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250318 Update</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build optimization (reduced loading time on first-time game execution)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized in-game sound (voice, BGM, SFX)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When is the moment you want to forget the most?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Soo-ah, a geek high school girl, and Shin Ha-yeon, a grumpy tsundere, and A, a high school student, are members of the science club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who gathered to prepare for the school summer festival lost their minds in the heat of summer vacation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Soo-ah, tired of the lame entry, declares the invention of the time machine...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the past, make the future! &quot;Leaf in Bootstrap&quot;, here we go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producer Information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by Eugene Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration: Halla Tangerine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shin Ha-yeon as Lee Eun-jo LEE EUN JO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Soo-ah as Herela HEOELLA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph